      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>86</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>79</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Lets arrange the letters of OUGHT in alphabetical order.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></math></p><p>Number of words starting with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Number of words starting with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Number of words starting with&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Number of words starting with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mi>G</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></math></p><p>Number of words starting with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Number of words starting with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>G</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Number of words starting with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Next word is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>TOUGH</mi></math>.</p><p>Hence, the serial number of&nbsp;the word&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>TOUGH</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mn>89</mn></math></p>"
  }
